 "applies_to": "Contemporary Controls BAST-221C and BAST-221CH (with humidity) Wi-Fi thermostats for multi-stage heating, cooling and ventilation, such as rooftop units.",
 "summary": "The BAST-221C-BW2 is a Wi-Fi BACnet IP thermostat for up to two cooling and two heating stages plus fan. The 221CH version adds humidity and dew point readings. It exposes temperatures, setpoints, system and fan modes, occupancy, relay control and status, and setup values as BACnet objects.",
