 "notes": [
  "From the BACnet Object Table (manual pages 34-42). The table is shared across the BASstat family; rows printed in grey (objects this model does not use) are left out.",
  "Access is from the Readable/Writable column; R/W objects are shown as writable.",
  "Temperature objects follow the Temperature Scale object (BV 6: 0 = °C, 1 = °F).",
  "Fan Mode (MV 0) states are printed as \"1: Auto 1: Low 3: Med. 4: Hi\" and are kept as printed.",
  "Current Humidity (AI 4) and Current Dew Point (AI 5) are on the 221CH model only."
 ],
